# OutlookEmail Desktop

**Read `AGENTS.md` first.** Docs synced 2026-07-09.

## Snapshot

- Tauri 2 + React/Vite/TS + Rust commands + SQLite (local-first, single-user desktop).
- Core done: Graph OAuth, IMAP sync (Gmail/QQ/163 presets), mailbox search/preview dialog, local mail share exports, scheduler (mail refresh only), workspace keys, themes (built-in preset).
- **M9 code complete;** remaining work = real Gmail/QQ/163 manual QA.
- **OAuth = Microsoft only** (`graph`, Outlook `imap`). Gmail uses IMAP app password; Gmail OAuth rejected in backend.

## Where to change things

- UI: `src/` — `App.tsx`, `api.ts`, `lib/providerRegistry.ts`, `lib/mailPreview.ts`, `lib/emailHtml.ts`
- Rust: `src-tauri/src/` — `commands.rs`, `db.rs`, `providers.rs`, `import.rs`
- Keep frontend and backend provider registries in sync.

## Rules

- No web service / extension / SaaS / Gmail OAuth unless user explicitly requests.
- Prefer minimal diffs; match existing patterns.
- Provider or mail changes: run `pnpm test` and `pnpm cargo:test`.
